Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	A gallery above a lava lake was built for shooting at winged targets, and the hornets that nest on its islets have made it a real hunt. Possess one of your shooters and bring them down.
Action	objective	1	Shoot down every hornet over the lava lake before time runs out.
Action	timelimit	420
Action	reveal	1	Lake
Action	order	wait	2	-	Crow1	Crow2	Crow3	Crow4
[/Trigger]
